# The languages this project ships translations for, one per line, as
# `po/<language>.po` and `<language>` in a locale directory (the convention
# `msgfmt --desktop -d po` and `msgfmt --xml -d po` read too, so the desktop
# file and the metainfo can be generated with the languages merged).
#
# It is empty on purpose: English is the source language, and a language pack
# is added (this file plus `po/<language>.po`) rather than shipped by S16.
# Nothing depends on a language being listed — with none, the install has the
# templates' own English text.
